1<=N<=10^{5}
1<=A[i]<=10^{5}

expected time complexity: O(N).
expected auxiliary space: O(1).

standard_solution_code:
def maxArea(A, le):
	max_area = 0
	l = 0
	r = len(A) - 1
	while l < r:
		max_area = max(max_area, (r - l) * min(A[r], A[l]))
		if A[l] <= A[r]:
			l += 1
		else:
			r -= 1
	return max_area
